---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | tszuk"
  description="tszuk is a branding studio in Port Elizabeth building identities that resonate, for companies and personalities alike."
>
  <div class="about">
    <section class="about__story bleed" aria-labelledby="about-story">
      <h1 class="about__eyebrow" id="about-story">About tszuk</h1>
      <p class="about__paragraph measure">
        We started tszuk because so much branding stops at the surface. A nice logo, a
        tidy palette, and not much underneath. We wanted to make brands that carry a
        feeling all the way through, from the first impression to the smallest detail.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about__vision bleed" aria-labelledby="about-vision">
      <h2 class="about__section-title" id="about-vision">Our Vision</h2>
      
      <blockquote class="about__quote">
        "When you create an ecommerce site, you are not just building a tool for people to buy. You are creating an experience that should feel like your brand."
      </blockquote>

      <p class="about__paragraph measure">
        That belief runs through everything we make. Every page, every interaction, every
        quiet moment of polish is a chance to make someone feel something. We treat every
        engagement as brand experience, not just delivery.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    min-height: 100vh;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Centered prose still needs the reading measure centered in the container. */
  .about .measure {
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about__story {
    padding-block: calc(var(--section-padding-mobile) + 2rem) 3rem;
    border-bottom: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-divider);
  }

  .about__vision {
    padding-block: 3rem var(--section-padding-mobile);
  }

  .about__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-mono);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about__paragraph {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
  }

  .about__section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-mono);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about__quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    max-width: var(--manifesto-max-width);
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about__story {
      padding-block: calc(var(--section-padding) + 1rem) 4rem;
    }

    .about__vision {
      padding-block: 4rem var(--section-padding);
    }

    .about__paragraph {
      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.8vw, 1.5rem);
    }
  }
</style>
